{
  "function": "parseProductSettings",
  "source": "src/main/launchers/riot/products.ts",
  "note": "decode: arg0=utf8\narg0 is <product>.<patchline>.product_settings.yaml as src/main/launchers/riot/adapter.ts reads it (readLauncherText: readFileSync, then toString utf8; a BOM stays as U+FEFF, invalid bytes become U+FFFD).\nThe function relies on readLauncherText for its size cap (4 MiB) and enforces none itself.\nLines split on \\r?\\n only: a lone CR stays inside a line, where the JS `.` of TOP_LEVEL_SCALAR does not match it (nor U+2028 or U+2029), so such a line reads as no key at all.",
